    "testimonials_7zeqRi": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_card_6zwy6a": {
          "type": "testimonial-card",
          "settings": {
            "show_rating": true,
            "rating": 5,
            "heading": "Incredibly Detailed & Clear!",
            "heading_type_preset": "h4",
            "heading_font_size_desktop": 20,
            "heading_font_size_mobile": 18,
            "text": "<p>The cut list was spot-on and saved me from ruining expensive hardwood. As a complete beginner, the 3D diagrams made assembly straightforward and stress-free. My workbench turned out rock solid.</p>",
            "author": "Elliot M."
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "testimonial_card_zwTdMh": {
          "type": "testimonial-card",
          "settings": {
            "show_rating": true,
            "rating": 5,
            "heading": "Perfect for Small Garages",
            "heading_type_preset": "h4",
            "heading_font_size_desktop": 20,
            "heading_font_size_mobile": 18,
            "text": "<p>I loved that I didn't need thousands of dollars in shop machinery to finish this project. The guide breaks down every joint using basic, standard tools. Truly the best woodworking plans I’ve bought online.</p>",
            "author": "James R."
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "testimonial_card_RUeNDU": {
          "type": "testimonial-card",
          "settings": {
            "show_rating": true,
            "rating": 5,
            "heading": "Instant Download, Zero Fluff",
            "heading_type_preset": "h4",
            "heading_font_size_desktop": 20,
            "heading_font_size_mobile": 18,
            "text": "<p>The download arrived in my inbox seconds after checkout. Having the PDF right on my tablet on the workbench made the build go twice as fast. Highly recommend Tranlepotun to any DIY creator.</p>",
            "author": "Emily T."
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
